wildos-lighting (0.2.0) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Runs the effects chosen on Cooler's Lighting page, over OpenRGB's SDK
    protocol: one effect across every part, parts set on their own, zone
    names, shapes, counts and sections, and Flash.
  * Until something is chosen in Cooler, the lighting follows the taskbar
    underglow exactly as before.

 -- Wild OS Developers <dev@wildos.io>  Wed, 18 Nov 2026 12:00:00 +0000

wildos-lighting (0.1.0) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Keyboard and mouse lighting that follows the taskbar underglow, through
    an OpenRGB server on the loopback that runs only while it is turned on.

 -- Wild OS Developers <dev@wildos.io>  Mon, 09 Nov 2026 12:00:00 +0000
